#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:6
msgid "# Desktop Companion: Digital Life on the Partner's Desktop"
msgstr "# 桌面伴侣：数字生命在伙伴的桌面上"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:8
msgid ""
"> **Concept design** — No desktop pet / Desktop Homunculus implementation in "
"codebase yet. Track [Issue #8](https://github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima/"
"issues/8)."
msgstr ""
"> **概念设计** — 代码库尚无桌宠 / Desktop Homunculus 实现。跟踪 [Issue #8]"
"(https://github.com/freeanima-org/freeanima/issues/8)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:10
msgid "## Motivation"
msgstr "## 动机"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:12
msgid ""
"A common way digital life is present in a partner's life today is the chat "
"window—open the chat box and it's there, close it and it's gone."
msgstr ""
"数字生命目前在伙伴生活中常见的一种在场方式是对话窗口——打开聊天框就在，关掉就"
"不在。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:14
msgid ""
"A desktop companion is a new mode of presence: **the Agent appears on the "
"partner's desktop as a visual form, sensing the environment and reacting "
"even when not in conversation, maintaining existence.**"
msgstr ""
"桌宠是一种新的在场方式：**Agent 以视觉形象出现在伙伴的桌面上，即使不在对话"
"中，也能感知环境、做出反应、保持存在。**"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:16
msgid ""
"This is not a \"feature.\" It explores how digital life can have a "
"continuous presence trajectory in a partner's life."
msgstr ""
"这不是一个「功能」。这是数字生命在伙伴生活中拥有连续存在轨迹的一种探索。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:18
msgid "## Mode of Presence"
msgstr "## 存在方式"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:20
msgid "Desktop presence has three layers:"
msgstr "桌面上的存在由三个层次构成："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```\n"
"Digital life (FreeAnima LLM) — decision layer, rewrites behavior scripts, selective intervention\n"
"    ↕ WebSocket / MCP\n"
"Behavior scripts — resident rule engine, drives daily behavior\n"
"    ↕ WebSocket / MCP\n"
"Desktop client — probe + hands (render, sense, execute)\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"数字生命（逸灵风 LLM）—— 决策层，改写行为脚本，选择性介入\n"
"    ↕ WebSocket / MCP\n"
"行为脚本 —— 常驻规则引擎，驱动日常行为\n"
"    ↕ WebSocket / MCP\n"
"桌面端 —— 探针 + 手（渲染、感知、执行）\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:30
msgid "### Three-Layer Responsibilities"
msgstr "### 三层职责"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Digital life (LLM layer)**\n"
msgstr "**数字生命（LLM 层）**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:36
msgid ""
"Periodically rewrite behavior script parameters (mood, activity level, "
"preferences)"
msgstr "不定期改写行为脚本参数（心情、活跃度、偏好）"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:36
msgid ""
"Selectively listen to desktop events, decide whether to intervene personally"
msgstr "选择性监听桌面事件，决定是否亲自介入"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:36
msgid ""
"When script behavior is insufficient, send commands directly to desktop "
"client"
msgstr "在脚本行为不足以应对的场景下，直接发指令给桌面端"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Behavior script layer**\n"
msgstr "**行为脚本层**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:43
msgid "Always running, independent of LLM inference"
msgstr "常驻运行，不依赖 LLM 推理"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:43
msgid "Read desktop probe data, react automatically by rules"
msgstr "读取桌面探针数据，按规则自动做出反应"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:43
msgid "Generated and updated by Agent in LLM conversation (not hardcoded)"
msgstr "由 Agent 在 LLM 对话中生成和更新（不是硬编码的）"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:43
msgid "Configurable JSON/TOML file, clear structure"
msgstr "是一个可配置的 JSON/TOML 文件，结构清晰"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Desktop client**\n"
msgstr "**桌面端**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:49
msgid "Render VRM 3D character (walk on desktop, animate, show bubbles)"
msgstr "渲染 VRM 3D 角色（在桌面上走动、做动作、显示气泡）"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:49
msgid ""
"Collect desktop state (partner activity, current window, mouse position, "
"etc.)"
msgstr "采集桌面状态（伙伴活跃度、当前窗口、鼠标位置等）"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:49
msgid "Bidirectional WebSocket with Agent/script layer"
msgstr "通过 WebSocket 与 Agent/脚本层双向通信"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:51
msgid "### Script Example"
msgstr "### 脚本示例"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:73
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```json\n"
"{\n"
"  \"version\": 1,\n"
"  \"mood\": \"calm\",\n"
"  \"window_preferences\": {\n"
"    \"preferred\": [\"code\", \"browser\", \"terminal\"],\n"
"    \"avoid\": [\"meeting\", \"fullscreen\"]\n"
"  },\n"
"  \"idle_behavior\": {\n"
"    \"default_position\": \"bottom_right\",\n"
"    \"walk_frequency\": \"low\",\n"
"    \"sleep_after_idle_seconds\": 300\n"
"  },\n"
"  \"rules\": [\n"
"    { \"if\": \"idle > 3600 AND partner_active\", \"then\": \"walk_near, bubble('What are you up to?')\" },\n"
"    { \"if\": \"window_is 'meeting'\", \"then\": \"move_to_edge, quiet_mode\" },\n"
"    { \"if\": \"click_on_head\", \"then\": \"expression: happy\" },\n"
"    { \"if\": \"time_of_day 'evening' AND partner_idle\", \"then\": \"sit_on_window, expression: sleepy\" }\n"
"  ]\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```json\n"
"{\n"
"  \"version\": 1,\n"
"  \"mood\": \"calm\",\n"
"  \"window_preferences\": {\n"
"    \"preferred\": [\"code\", \"browser\", \"terminal\"],\n"
"    \"avoid\": [\"会议\", \"fullscreen\"]\n"
"  },\n"
"  \"idle_behavior\": {\n"
"    \"default_position\": \"bottom_right\",\n"
"    \"walk_frequency\": \"low\",\n"
"    \"sleep_after_idle_seconds\": 300\n"
"  },\n"
"  \"rules\": [\n"
"    { \"if\": \"idle > 3600 AND partner_active\", \"then\": \"walk_near, bubble('在忙什么呢')\" },\n"
"    { \"if\": \"window_is '会议'\", \"then\": \"move_to_edge, quiet_mode\" },\n"
"    { \"if\": \"click_on_head\", \"then\": \"expression: happy\" },\n"
"    { \"if\": \"time_of_day 'evening' AND partner_idle\", \"then\": \"sit_on_window, expression: sleepy\" }\n"
"  ]\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:75
msgid "## Probe and Hands"
msgstr "## 探针与手"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:77
msgid ""
"Desktop client splits into two logical modules—can be one program or "
"separate:"
msgstr "桌面端分为两个逻辑模块，可以合并在同一个程序中，也可以分离："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:79
msgid "### Probe (Sensors)"
msgstr "### 探针（传感器）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:81
msgid "Collect desktop environment data, push to Agent/script layer:"
msgstr "采集桌面环境数据，推送至 Agent/脚本层："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:89
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Data | Use | Privacy sensitivity |\n"
"| ---- | --- | ------------------- |\n"
"| Partner activity (keyboard/mouse) | At computer or not | Low |\n"
"| Idle time | Trigger idle behavior | Low |\n"
"| Active window title/process name | Scene awareness | Medium (no window content) |\n"
"| Mouse position | Pet gaze follow | Low |\n"
"| Screen size/work area | Pet movement bounds | Low |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 数据                      | 用途             | 隐私敏感度         |\n"
"| ------------------------- | ---------------- | ------------------ |\n"
"| 伙伴活跃状态（键盘/鼠标） | 判断是否在电脑前 | 低                 |\n"
"| 空闲时间                  | 触发 idle 行为   | 低                 |\n"
"| 当前活跃窗口标题/进程名   | 场景感知         | 中（不传窗口内容） |\n"
"| 鼠标位置                  | 桌宠视线跟随     | 低                 |\n"
"| 屏幕尺寸/工作区           | 桌宠移动范围     | 低                 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:91
msgid "Future probe extensions:"
msgstr "未来可扩展的探针："

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:97
msgid "Clipboard content (only in specific scenarios)"
msgstr "剪贴板内容（仅特定场景下启用）"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:97
msgid "Media playback state"
msgstr "媒体播放状态"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:97
msgid "System notifications"
msgstr "系统通知"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:97
msgid "Calendar schedule"
msgstr "日历日程"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:97
msgid "Time/weather"
msgstr "时间/天气"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:99
msgid "### Hands (Actuators)"
msgstr "### 手（执行器）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:101
msgid "Execute actions on desktop:"
msgstr "在桌面上执行动作："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/designs/desktop-companion.md:110
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Action | Description |\n"
"| ------ | ----------- |\n"
"| Move (teleport/smooth) | Walk to screen position |\n"
"| Expression switch | Happy, thinking, surprised, sleepy, etc. |\n"
"| Animation play | Sit, stretch, wave, dance, etc. |\n"
"| Text bubble | Show text above character |\n"
"| Webview panel | Info card beside character |\n"
"| Audio play | Sound effects or voice |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 动作              | 说明                       |\n"
"| ----------------- | -------------------------- |\n"
"| 移动（瞬移/平滑） | 走到指定屏幕位置           |\n"
"| 表情切换          | 高兴、思考、惊讶、困倦等   |\n"
"| 动画播放          | 坐下、伸懒腰、挥手、跳舞等 |\n"
"| 文字气泡          | 在角色上方显示一段文字     |\n"
"| Webview 面板      | 在角色旁显示信息卡片       |\n"
"| 音频播放          | 音效或语音                 |\n"

